<title>USA: Guilford Phara gets nerve growth patent.</title>
<headline>Guilford Phara gets nerve growth patent.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guilford Pharmaceuticals Inc said on Thursday that it has been issued a U.S. patent relating to the compositions and uses of a series of compounds that promote nerve growth and repair for the treatment of neurodegenerative disorders.</p>
<p>Guilford said that the compounds are neuroimmunophilin ligands, which are orally-active and cross the blood-brain-barrier in animal models.</p>
</text>
